# 3. Hosting and international performance

This is one of the most important considerations for a Uganda-based company targeting the international market.

You should optimize for three different environments:

- Kampala and other Ugandan cities.
- Other African markets.
- International markets, especially Europe and North America.

Do not design exclusively around the fastest internet connection available to you.

