2. Keyboard-only navigation.
3. Screen readers.
4. Browser zoom.
5. Mobile accessibility.
6. Manual contrast review.

Automated testing does not prove complete accessibility. Manual testing is still necessary.

# 8. Security and privacy

A company selling software engineering services must demonstrate responsible handling of information.

Even a relatively simple public website has a security surface.

## Security requirements

| Area             | Requirement                                                |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| Transport        | HTTPS everywhere                                           |
| TLS              | Modern supported TLS configuration                         |
| HSTS             | Configure after HTTPS and domain readiness are verified    |
| CSP              | Restrict permitted scripts, frames, styles and connections |
| XSS              | Avoid unsafe HTML rendering                                |
| Input validation | Validate on the server                                     |
| Spam protection  | Rate limits and appropriate bot protection                 |
| Secrets          | Never expose credentials in browser JavaScript             |
| Dependencies     | Regular security and vulnerability checks                  |
| DNS              | Strong account protection and restricted access            |
| Admin access     | MFA and least privilege                                    |
| Logging          | No passwords, access tokens or unnecessary personal data   |

Astro 6 includes CSP support, while Cloudflare Pages allows custom HTTP response headers through `_headers`. Both should be configured carefully and tested against the final production site.&#x20;

