## International privacy

Do not assume that operating from Uganda means only Ugandan privacy law matters.

For example, GDPR can apply to an organization outside the European Union when its processing relates to offering goods or services to people in the EU or monitoring their behaviour there. Merely having a globally accessible website does not by itself establish that every GDPR obligation applies.&#x20;

