| Observability   | Availability, errors and performance measured            |
| Maintainability | Documentation, typed content and controlled dependencies |

Three principles should govern the entire project:

1. Performance is a feature: Do not sacrifice speed for unnecessary visual effects.
2. Credibility is earned: Show genuine engineering work instead of manufacturing trust signals.
3. Engineering decisions must be justified: Do not introduce complexity without a measurable reason.

